    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Biodiversity refers to the variety of all the different species of organisms on Earth or within a specific ecosystem. It is critical because high biodiversity helps maintain ecosystem stability and allows natural sustainability for all life forms.</p>",
